<title>SINGAPORE: ASIA Ltd, CapMAC in US$300 million MBS plan.</title>
<headline>ASIA Ltd, CapMAC in US$300 million MBS plan.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian Securitization &amp; Infrastructure Assurance (Pte) Ltd (ASIA Ltd), in conjunction with Capital Markets Assurance Corp (CapMAC), expects to provide credit enhancement for a US$300 million mortgage backed security (MBS) note issue, ASIA Ltd said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>ASIA Ltd's principal shareholders are CapMAC, the Asian Development Bank and the Government of Singapore Investment Corp.</p>
<p>CapMAC is a financial guarantee insurance company based in New York.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
